# No long dashes in answers

Critical. In all chat replies, Markdown, commit messages, and docs you write in this session:

- Do NOT use em dash (U+2014)
- Do NOT use en dash (U+2013)
- Do NOT use figure dash or horizontal bar
- Use only the ASCII hyphen-minus: `-`

## Examples

Wrong: `master - with long glyph`, ranges with en/em dash glyphs

Right: `мастер - primary`, `22:00-01:00`, `precreate - основной щит`

For ranges prefer `from-to` or `A - B`, not a long dash glyph.

If a draft contains em dash or en dash characters, replace them with `-` before sending.